You have to destroy your 
opponent's composure to win.

00:23:28.970 --> 00:23:31.310
Chess isn't about winning or losing.

00:23:31.720 --> 00:23:34.880
Episode 9 - Double Joker (Part 2)

00:23:33.250 --> 00:23:34.880
